    "windows/shots/src/look.rs and macos/Sources/Features/Screenshot/ShotLook.swift;",
    "tools/the-screenshot-look-is-one-set.py is red when either is out of step.",
    "Lengths are logical points unless a name says otherwise. A colour is #RRGGBB and an alpha from 0 to 1.",
    "Durations are milliseconds.",
    "outside_live names the icons whose ink leaves the live area, with the box it has (left, top, right, bottom,",
    "stroke included). The gate holds every other icon to the live area and these to exactly these boxes."
